OL,3,GNEWSAI took in three children with my
OL,4,Ahusband, who was adopted, then found
OL,5,Aout at 40 that I was too
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwelve years ago, Catherine Cullen had
OL,8,Falready adopted two children with her
OL,9,Fhusband - himself an adoptee - when she
OL,10,Fmade a shocking discovery.
OL,12,F"I was registering a child's birth and
OL,13,FI wanted the long version of my birth
OL,14,Fcertificate, which I had never had,"
OL,15,Fshe said.
OL,17,F"I ordered it and when it came, it was
OL,18,Fadoption certificate, not a birth
OL,19,Fcertificate."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
